	<informations>Front view of the EPP2338-0002 at the scale 1:5 (1 px = 5 mm), 30 x 126 x 26.5 mm (width x height x depth). Generic outline, no logo; check the dimensions on the data sheet of your exact version. Silhouette traced by eye on a photo (ears with the two M3 fixing holes, 3.5 mm, hole position assumed). Fixing (verified, Beckhoff EPP2xxx documentation, Fixing): two M3 bolts longer than 15 mm, holes not threaded, no torque given. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
